Package: scrustio
Type: Package
Title: Load scrust Outputs into Seurat and SingleCellExperiment Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Author: scRust contributors
Maintainer: scRust contributors <scrust-maintainers@example.org>
Description: Reads the plain files that scRust's command-line tool (scrust)
    writes, through the manifest in each output's summary.json (schema
    scrust-files, version 1), and builds Seurat 5.5.1 objects (with an SCT
    assay and its SCTModel as SCTransform makes them) and SingleCellExperiment
    objects. Each matrix goes only into a slot meant for its scale: the raw
    counts into the raw-count slots, SCTransform's corrected counts, their log1p
    and the residuals only into slots for normalised data.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/harvardinformatics/scRust
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports: methods, utils, tools, stats, Matrix, jsonlite
Suggests: Seurat (>= 5.5.1), SeuratObject (>= 5.4.0), SingleCellExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment, S4Vectors
